# The Dunce Rage Quit (2026-10-26, the owner's idea). Now and then a bot asks something truly dumb in /faction, the
# whole realm piles on, the dunce gets angrier and angrier and rage quits: "@exit A" logs that bot off for 2-6 hours
# once the scene has played to its end (AutonomousBotSchedule.RageQuit), and it comes back sheepish ("ragequit_back").
# Roles B-H are the pile-on; they tease, they don't use real insults. New writing.

@kind debate
@realm *

