C: your horse | ...your horse
D: have you tried feeding it xp potions | try killing blues with it, horses need bubbles too
E: you dont own the horse. the stablemaster owns the horse. you rent a seat | the horse belongs to the stable, you just sit on it
A: no but it says im on a horse and it goes the same speed every time | it says im riding. why cant i make it go faster
F: have you tried yelling at it | try saying giddyup in /say, works every time
G: screenshot. this is going on the guild site | oh this is getting framed
B: i think he wants to spec into horse | someone tell him theres no horse trainer before he finds the dog trainer
A: ok forget it, everyone here is useless | why is everyone so mean, it was a real question
