A: you know what, i dont even care. this game is dumb | this is the worst realm i swear
E: ok ok. horses are a ride between towns, you cant train them. they go one speed | the stable horses are a fixed route, nobody can speed them up. thats all
A: TOO LATE. im done. have fun with your stupid horses | NOPE. done. uninstalling. enjoy your slow horses
F: dont forget to unsubscribe the horse | bye, the horse will miss you
A: BYE | BYE ALL
~ 6
G: did he actually log | he actually left lol
B: gg | rip horse guy
